# @auki/$crate_package_name

wasm-bindgen JavaScript bindings for `auki-geometry`.

```js
import init, { convertPointConventionJson } from "./$generated_js_file";

await init();

const converted = JSON.parse(convertPointConventionJson(
  JSON.stringify({ x: 100.0, y: 200.0, z: 300.0 }),
  JSON.stringify({
    frame_id: "camera",
    handedness: "right",
    axes: { x: "right", y: "down", z: "forward" },
    units: "centimeters",
  }),
  JSON.stringify({
    frame_id: "world",
    handedness: "right",
    axes: { x: "right", y: "up", z: "backward" },
    units: "meters",
  }),
));
```

The package exposes JSON-string adapters over pure convention math. It does not
read registry files, open logs, or fetch frame entries.
